But it's such a big flaw.

336
16:51.030 --> 16:52.360
If I can think of it,

337
16:52.670 --> 16:55.120
how could Li Qingyang not?

338
16:55.360 --> 16:57.030
Since the incident 2 months ago,

339
16:57.030 --> 16:58.030
he hasn't taken any

340
16:58.030 --> 16:59.360
precautions or cover-ups.

341
16:59.360 --> 17:02.360
Isn't he just waiting for people to come and catch him?

342
17:04.240 --> 17:05.720
If he is the real culprit,

343
17:06.920 --> 17:08.180
it doesn't make sense.

344
17:13.829 --> 17:15.200
Have you ever seen

345
17:15.550 --> 17:17.550
what the puppet doll in the Bugui Manor

346
17:17.550 --> 17:18.960
looks like?

347
17:19.270 --> 17:20.349
I haven't,

348
17:20.349 --> 17:22.480
but I've heard witness descriptions.

349
17:23.030 --> 17:25.160
Then how can you be sure

350
17:25.829 --> 17:28.030
that the one in the Star-Gathering Pavilion

351
17:28.030 --> 17:29.680
must be the one

352
17:29.680 --> 17:30.790
in the Bugui Manor?

353
17:34.830 --> 17:35.790
I can't be sure.

354
17:36.270 --> 17:37.480
But I'd rather catch the wrong person

355
17:37.480 --> 17:39.000
than miss any clues.

356
17:40.680 --> 17:42.030
Zhenzhu, over the years,

357
17:42.030 --> 17:44.090
you have become more and more steady.

358
17:44.310 --> 17:45.550
Zhenzhu is right.

359
17:45.880 --> 17:47.030
I also think

360
17:47.110 --> 17:48.270
that Li Qingyang seems

361
17:48.270 --> 17:50.440
to want to be caught by the Divine Constable Bureau.

362
17:50.440 --> 17:51.240
Otherwise,

363
17:51.350 --> 17:52.680
why would he put a puppet doll

364
17:52.680 --> 17:53.790
in his own room

365
17:54.030 --> 17:56.030
and arouse suspicion for no reason?

366
17:57.680 --> 17:59.510
In just 3 years,

367
17:59.750 --> 18:00.750
Li Qingyang

368
18:00.880 --> 18:03.290
turned a desolate suburban area

369
18:03.510 --> 18:05.030
into a bustling paradise

370
18:05.030 --> 18:06.070
for the rich.

371
18:08.510 --> 18:10.270
He is

372
18:10.720 --> 18:12.440
indeed quite something.

373
18:12.880 --> 18:14.440
Chief, please instruct us

374
18:14.510 --> 18:16.170
on how we should deal with him.

375
18:17.960 --> 18:19.960
Take him to the interrogation room.

376
18:20.240 --> 18:21.970
No need for interrogation yet.

377
18:22.240 --> 18:23.030
Just

378
18:23.550 --> 18:25.400
don't guard him too closely.

379
18:26.790 --> 18:27.590
-Yes. -Yes.

380
19:30.740 --> 19:33.000
[Tianshu Pavilion]

381
19:39.250 --> 19:41.260
[Tianshu Pavilion]

382
19:42.290 --> 19:43.090
[Tianshu Pavilion]

383
19:48.850 --> 19:51.530
[Tianshu Pavilion]

384
19:49.030 --> 19:50.830
So this is the Tianshu Pavilion.

385
19:51.240 --> 19:52.640
In the 72 years the Shi Dynasty

386
19:52.640 --> 19:53.900
has been established,

387
19:53.920 --> 19:55.920
all case files—big and small—

388
19:56.030 --> 19:57.480
and even secret anecdotes,

389
19:56.570 --> 19:58.250
[Tianshu Pavilion]

390
19:57.480 --> 19:58.880
are recorded here.

391
19:59.440 --> 20:00.590
I hope

392
20:00.880 --> 20:02.400
it holds the answers I'm looking for.

393
20:02.060 --> 20:04.360
[Tianshu Pavilion]

394
20:05.440 --> 20:07.030
Better to storm the King of Hell's Palace

395
20:07.030 --> 20:09.290
than enter the Divine Constable Bureau.

396
20:17.960 --> 20:18.750
You

397
20:19.030 --> 20:20.550
came to the wrong place.

398
20:23.750 --> 20:24.550
Strange.

399
20:24.830 --> 20:26.480
Why didn't I sense

400
20:26.480 --> 20:28.480
a trace of his inner energy just now?

401
20:31.070 --> 20:32.280
[Tianshu Pavilion]

402
20:35.430 --> 20:38.600
[Constable Ghost, Meng Rui]

403
20:40.750 --> 20:41.640
Someone once

404
20:41.640 --> 20:43.880
tried to break into the Tianshu Pavilion,

405
20:43.880 --> 20:45.240
but couldn't even climb over

406
20:45.240 --> 20:46.440
the Bureau's wall.

407
20:46.610 --> 20:48.180
[Tianshu Pavilion]

408
20:47.510 --> 20:48.680
You are different.

409
20:49.270 --> 20:51.310
You turned yourself in first,

410
20:51.830 --> 20:53.440
and then sought death.

411
20:54.750 --> 20:56.270
But to me,

412
20:56.960 --> 20:58.510
both methods

413
20:59.350 --> 21:00.590
are equally stupid.

414
21:00.990 --> 21:04.060
[Tianshu Pavilion]

415
21:01.550 --> 21:02.550
My Lord,

416
21:02.720 --> 21:03.960
why do you say that?

417
21:04.480 --> 21:06.160
I was invited by Constable Frost

418
21:06.160 --> 21:07.270
and Constable Eagle

419
21:07.270 --> 21:09.240
to have tea at your Bureau.

420
21:09.510 --> 21:11.710
Trespassing into the Tianshu Pavilion

421
21:11.920 --> 21:12.920
is punishable...

422
21:16.270 --> 21:17.160
by death.

423
21:17.010 --> 21:18.890
[Tianshu Pavilion]

424
21:18.200 --> 21:19.000
Don't.

425
21:19.350 --> 21:21.480
I haven't even been interrogated yet.

426
21:21.480 --> 21:22.830
I can't die yet.

427
21:34.030 --> 21:35.640
The sword is not yet unsheathed,

428
21:35.640 --> 21:36.720
but its aura has already

429
21:36.720 --> 21:38.250
spread for several meters.

430
21:38.480 --> 21:39.590
Could you be...

431
21:40.510 --> 21:41.770
Lord Constable Ghost?

432
21:42.160 --> 21:43.400
Surrender,

433
21:44.110 --> 21:45.840
and I'll spare you for a moment.

434
21:46.070 --> 21:48.000
You speak as if you've already won.

435
21:48.510 --> 21:50.400
We haven't started fighting yet.

436
21:50.550 --> 21:51.830
You asked for it.

437
21:51.960 --> 21:53.110
So stubborn!

438
23:09.720 --> 23:10.590
Illusion?

439
23:15.160 --> 23:24.350
[Tianshu Pavilion]

440
23:20.030 --> 23:21.110
People say

441
23:21.440 --> 23:22.550
that Constable Ghost's strike

442
23:22.550 --> 23:23.750
leaves no survivors.

443
23:31.270 --> 23:32.400
But this time,

444
23:33.070 --> 23:34.720
you missed.

445
23:37.680 --> 23:39.410
You are indeed quite skillful.

446
23:40.240 --> 23:41.500
Lord Constable Ghost,

447
23:42.160 --> 23:43.680
you started first.

448
23:44.270 --> 23:45.240
Now,

449
23:45.750 --> 23:47.480
let me show you mine.

450
23:57.880 --> 23:59.510
After 17 years of peace,

451
24:00.310 --> 24:02.550
the winds are finally rising.

452
24:11.270 --> 24:13.350
Heaven has eyes; Qian is above.

453
24:13.960 --> 24:16.620
Winds rise over the Capital; Xun is at the flank.

454
24:19.820 --> 24:22.310
Qian over Xun; forming the "Gou" Encounter.

455
24:23.720 --> 24:25.750
A star falls from the heavens; the will defies fate.

456
24:25.750 --> 24:28.950
The world is swept by wind; a mandate to the four quarters.

457
24:29.270 --> 24:30.630
Arrogant Dragon Thousand-Mechanism Formation

458
24:30.630 --> 24:32.590
[Arrogant Dragon Thousand-Mechanism Formation; heaven meeting wind]

459
24:42.390 --> 24:44.420
They say in Tianhuang City,

460
24:44.450 --> 24:46.790
only the Divine Constable Bureau can use strange arts.

461
24:46.790 --> 24:48.960
It seems true.

462
24:48.960 --> 24:51.240
This fight with you

463
24:51.260 --> 24:52.600
was really thrilling.

464
24:57.430 --> 25:00.090
[In the Shi Dynasty's 37th year of Hongyun,]

465
25:00.160 --> 25:01.540
[Several children went missing one after another]

466
25:01.540 --> 25:03.720
[in Suzhou's Doudou County.]

467
25:04.480 --> 25:05.920
[According to the witness,]

468
25:05.920 --> 25:08.550
[a puppet doll appeared.]

469
26:06.960 --> 26:11.540
[Tianhuang City outskirts, Underworld Market]

470
26:12.880 --> 26:14.480
Pull harder! Pull!

471
26:17.110 --> 26:18.110
Young Master is here!

472
26:18.110 --> 26:18.960
Young Master!

473
26:19.550 --> 26:21.110
Young Master, you look great.

474
26:21.110 --> 26:22.720
So elegant and stylish.

475
26:22.720 --> 26:24.440
Young Master, this Dragon Snake Gall

476
26:24.440 --> 26:26.070
has 60 years of cultivation.

477
26:26.090 --> 26:26.920
Divine weapon—

478
26:26.920 --> 26:27.920
Gan Jiang and Mo Ye!

479
26:27.920 --> 26:28.640
If you don't like it,

480
26:28.640 --> 26:29.750
I have the Invincible Tai'e too.

481
26:29.750 --> 26:30.720
It's definitely—

482
26:30.720 --> 26:33.350
Don't miss it as you pass by.

483
26:33.640 --> 26:36.030
These are the results of my lifelong medical practice,

484
26:36.030 --> 26:38.720
made with my life's effort.

485
26:38.920 --> 26:40.440
Dragon-Eye Rabbit Liver.

486
26:40.480 --> 26:42.080
It's concentrated essence.

487
26:42.440 --> 26:43.510
I want it!

488
26:43.590 --> 26:44.400
Slowly.

489
26:45.270 --> 26:46.480
Slowly, slowly.

490
26:46.480 --> 26:48.640
Hundred-Year-Old Dragon-Eye Rabbit Liver.

491
26:48.640 --> 26:50.900
It's 3 taels of gold and 3 taels of silver.

492
26:52.510 --> 26:53.680
Slowly.

493
26:54.480 --> 26:55.270
Slowly—

494
26:58.070 --> 26:59.420
Young Master.

495
27:03.200 --> 27:04.070
How is it? Does it work?

496
27:04.070 --> 27:04.790
How is it?

497
27:04.810 --> 27:06.000
Does it work?

498
27:06.020 --> 27:07.250
Does it work?

499
27:07.510 --> 27:08.440
Tell us quickly.

500
27:09.510 --> 27:10.790
What a petty trick.

501
27:11.720 --> 27:13.050
It's just a painkiller.

502
27:13.510 --> 27:15.310
Instead of letting you cheat people here,

503
27:15.310 --> 27:16.840
you might as well let me have it cheap.

504
27:16.840 --> 27:18.010
So it was a lie.

505
27:18.110 --> 27:19.570
These are fake medicines?

506
27:20.310 --> 27:22.310
They're not. They're not!

507
27:22.790 --> 27:23.720
They're not.

508
27:23.780 --> 27:25.920
I'll just compensate you.

509
27:25.920 --> 27:26.640
Pay up!

510
27:27.310 --> 27:28.670
I'll compensate you.

511
27:29.730 --> 27:32.600
Pay up!

512
27:32.630 --> 27:34.590
Pay us!

513
27:34.640 --> 27:35.480
Don't think that because of this,

514
27:35.480 --> 27:36.160
you don't have to pay!

515
27:36.160 --> 27:37.030
What's wrong?

516
27:37.920 --> 27:39.480
Let's go back to the clinic first.

517
27:39.480 --> 27:40.880
You really make me worry.

518
27:47.240 --> 27:47.920
Bear with it.

519
27:47.920 --> 27:48.880
It'll hurt.

520
27:49.960 --> 27:50.750
Lighter!

521
27:51.070 --> 27:52.440
Okay, almost done.

522
27:59.960 --> 28:01.000
Constable Ghost's Reaper Sword

523
28:01.000 --> 28:02.860
truly lives up to its reputation.

524
28:03.030 --> 28:04.110
If your clone hadn't

525
28:04.110 --> 28:05.970
drawn away most of his sword aura,

526
28:06.110 --> 28:07.750
you would be dead by now.

527
28:06.340 --> 28:09.650
[Li San]

528
28:08.680 --> 28:10.140
You are not careful at all.

529
28:13.880 --> 28:15.160
It's just a flesh wound.

530
28:15.160 --> 28:16.030
It's fine.

531
28:19.510 --> 28:20.350
If I had known,

532
28:20.750 --> 28:22.110
I shouldn't have mentioned the

533
28:22.110 --> 28:24.240
missing girls case in Tianhuang City.

534
28:24.720 --> 28:26.640
Hearing about puppet dolls,

535
28:27.920 --> 28:29.830
you acted like you went crazy.

536
28:29.880 --> 28:30.740
Look at you now—

537
28:30.880 --> 28:34.140
you made yourself a suspect trying to investigate things.

538
28:34.350 --> 28:36.030
That was also my own plan,

539
28:36.270 --> 28:37.070
okay?

540
28:37.070 --> 28:37.720
Sure.

541
28:38.030 --> 28:39.070
You are great.

542
28:39.920 --> 28:41.000
All right, almost done.

543
28:41.000 --> 28:41.960
Almost done.

544
28:43.110 --> 28:45.030
Once the Severe-Cold Sword is drawn,

545
28:45.030 --> 28:46.030
someone must die.

546
28:46.720 --> 28:49.180
This is the rule set by you, Constable Ghost.

547
28:49.750 --> 28:50.890
But tonight,

548
28:51.110 --> 28:52.550
to execute my order,

549
28:52.550 --> 28:53.880
you broke your rule.

550
28:54.030 --> 28:55.310
I must've put you on the spot.

551
28:55.310 --> 28:56.970
The method the opponent used,

552
28:57.110 --> 28:58.130
taking Bagua as the formation

553
28:58.130 --> 28:59.550
and the Five Elements as weapons,

554
28:59.550 --> 29:00.310
was incredibly powerful—

555
29:00.310 --> 29:01.550
something I've never seen.

556
29:01.550 --> 29:02.640
I feel

557
29:03.240 --> 29:04.960
they didn't use their full strength either.

558
29:04.960 --> 29:06.160
You mean

559
29:06.960 --> 29:09.030
he is the one who actually held back?

560
29:09.790 --> 29:10.590
That's right.

561
29:13.430 --> 29:14.550
In your opinion,

562
29:14.960 --> 29:16.110
why would he risk his life

563
29:16.110 --> 29:17.960
to barge into the Tianshu Pavilion?

564
29:17.960 --> 29:18.920
I don't know.

565
29:19.160 --> 29:20.270
17 years ago,

566
29:20.350 --> 29:21.440
the last thing I saw

567
29:21.920 --> 29:23.450
at the Mulan Hunting Ground

568
29:23.550 --> 29:25.070
was a puppet doll.

569
29:41.880 --> 29:42.680
Now

570
29:43.070 --> 29:45.160
puppet dolls have reappeared in Tianhuang City,

571
29:45.160 --> 29:45.960
I think

572
29:46.350 --> 29:47.960
there must be some connection

573
29:47.960 --> 29:49.510
between these two.

574
29:58.350 --> 29:59.550
Seventeen years ago,

575
30:00.030 --> 30:01.690
after my death was announced,

576
30:02.270 --> 30:04.110
the former Chief, Lu Chong,

577
30:04.310 --> 30:05.840
was dismissed from office.

578
30:06.110 --> 30:07.110
So I guess

579
30:07.550 --> 30:09.640
the Divine Constable Bureau must be involved

580
30:09.640 --> 30:12.440
in what happened 17 years ago.

581
30:13.510 --> 30:15.710
The files related to that year's events

582
30:15.750 --> 30:17.000
should also be locked in

583
30:17.000 --> 30:19.800
the Divine Constable Bureau's Tianshu Pavilion.

584
30:23.350 --> 30:25.110
I almost got in.

585
30:26.420 --> 30:27.680
Who would have thought

586
30:28.110 --> 30:30.840
Constable Gui would come out of nowhere halfway.

587
30:31.520 --> 30:32.800
So what if you find out

588
30:32.830 --> 30:33.880
the truth?

589
30:35.070 --> 30:37.870
Back then, the darn emperor announced to the world

590
30:38.070 --> 30:40.070
that the Fourth Prince, Zhou Yan...

591
30:41.490 --> 30:42.550
was dead.

592
30:43.400 --> 30:45.350
You are now my disciple,

593
30:45.720 --> 30:46.550
Li Si.

594
30:55.610 --> 30:57.680
It's been 17 years.

595
31:04.250 --> 31:06.040
[ Emperor Qi Huai, the God of Yan]

596
31:20.020 --> 31:27.030
[King Qi Huai of the Great World]

597
31:25.270 --> 31:27.240
I gave you a choice back then.

598
31:27.510 --> 31:28.440
I can't do it.

599
31:31.830 --> 31:33.070
For these 17 years,

600
31:34.070 --> 31:35.730
there hasn't been a single day

601
31:35.830 --> 31:37.560
I didn't want to know the truth.

602
31:41.480 --> 31:42.340
Over the years,

603
31:44.270 --> 31:47.350
I learned martial arts, did business,

604
31:48.070 --> 31:49.680
and opened the Star-Gathering Pavilion

605
31:49.680 --> 31:51.610
to collect various intelligence.

606
31:51.960 --> 31:53.750
As Young Master Qingyang,

607
31:53.960 --> 31:55.960
I also befriended the Crown Prince.

608
31:56.480 --> 31:57.510
I did all this

609
31:58.440 --> 32:00.070
to find out exactly

610
32:01.350 --> 32:02.790
who wanted to harm me

611
32:02.790 --> 32:03.960
back then,

612
32:04.510 --> 32:05.680
and who

613
32:06.480 --> 32:07.550
abducted me.

614
32:10.480 --> 32:12.160
I must find out

615
32:12.960 --> 32:14.680
what exactly happened

616
32:14.680 --> 32:15.960
17 years ago

617
32:17.240 --> 32:18.920
at the Mulan Hunting Ground.

618
32:21.550 --> 32:22.350
I...

619
32:23.830 --> 32:25.550
will never let all this

620
32:26.350 --> 32:28.160
remain up in the air.

621
33:00.660 --> 33:02.450
Young Master Qingyang...

622
33:03.630 --> 33:06.490
What does what happened at the Mulan Hunting Ground

623
33:07.530 --> 33:09.990
17 years ago have to do with you?

624
33:14.780 --> 33:17.110
[The Great Qi Huai, God of Yan]

625
33:19.510 --> 33:21.350
I want to go home!

626
33:24.110 --> 33:27.550
I want to go home!

627
33:28.370 --> 33:29.440
Where are you?

628
33:30.160 --> 33:32.240
Where are you? I want to go home.

629
33:32.550 --> 33:35.830
I want to go home!

630
33:36.130 --> 33:39.200
I want to go home!

631
33:42.750 --> 33:44.640
I want to go home. Tell me.

632
33:45.510 --> 33:48.680
Who did this to you? Don't go. I want to go home.

633
33:48.680 --> 33:49.350
Don't go.

634
33:50.550 --> 33:51.350
Don't go!

635
33:51.750 --> 33:52.550
Don't go!

636
34:11.440 --> 34:12.840
This old geezer.

637
34:13.760 --> 34:15.560
Where did he put the Qilin blood?

638
34:15.760 --> 34:17.320
Master, Master!

639
34:17.960 --> 34:19.110
I just got news that

640
34:19.110 --> 34:20.190
the Divine Constable Bureau's men

641
34:20.190 --> 34:20.920
went out the west city gate

642
34:20.920 --> 34:22.980
and headed straight for Bugui Manor!

643
34:24.800 --> 34:26.600
Keep it down.

644
34:27.710 --> 34:29.070
He finally fell asleep.

645
34:29.070 --> 34:30.550
What if you wake him up?

646
34:30.670 --> 34:31.760
If you let him know,

647
34:31.760 --> 34:33.820
he'll rise from the dead, believe it?

648
34:34.760 --> 34:36.150
He did! He just did!

649
34:43.360 --> 34:44.360
Stop right there.

650
34:45.960 --> 34:47.090
Where are you going?

651
34:47.550 --> 34:48.510
To Bugui Manor.

652
34:50.550 --> 34:53.550
Going to mess with the Divine Constable Bureau again?

653
34:53.960 --> 34:54.760
Master,

654
34:56.440 --> 34:58.710
the Divine Constable Bureau making such a big move

655
34:58.710 --> 35:00.710
must mean some progress in the case.

656
35:01.230 --> 35:02.230
As you know,

657
35:02.440 --> 35:03.550
this is the only clue

658
35:03.550 --> 35:05.080
to finding the puppet doll.

659
35:05.670 --> 35:06.930
I want to solve the case

660
35:07.440 --> 35:08.760
even more than they do.

661
35:10.920 --> 35:11.960
You can't stop me.

662
35:17.110 --> 35:18.440
You're injured,

663
35:18.550 --> 35:20.550
and you have an old heart condition.

664
35:21.920 --> 35:24.230
The Arrogant Dragon Thousand-Mechanism Formation—

665
35:24.230 --> 35:26.550
you must never use it again.

666
35:41.440 --> 35:42.360
I know.

667
35:42.840 --> 35:43.670
Don't worry,

668
35:44.030 --> 35:45.280
I'll be fine.

669
35:46.280 --> 35:48.110
I must live well

670
35:48.440 --> 35:51.440
so I can take care of you in your old age and send you off.

671
35:52.670 --> 35:53.480
I'm off.

672
35:55.510 --> 35:57.640
You remember that quite clearly, huh!

673
35:59.960 --> 36:00.760
Remember!

674
36:00.920 --> 36:02.450
You must never use it again!

675
36:13.920 --> 36:15.810
An inescapable net, no way to fly!

676
36:37.550 --> 36:38.360
Lord Constable Frost,

677
36:38.360 --> 36:39.190
informants say

678
36:39.190 --> 36:39.960
it was here

679
36:39.960 --> 36:42.020
that the missing girls were spotted.

680
36:43.800 --> 36:44.440
Search!

681
36:44.460 --> 36:45.270
Yes.

682
36:50.630 --> 36:52.290
All the bodies found are here.

683
36:52.430 --> 36:53.830
These should be

684
36:53.860 --> 36:55.230
the 9 missing girls.

685
36:56.320 --> 36:58.110
No trace of the suspect was found at the scene.

686
36:58.110 --> 36:59.110
But judging from

687
36:59.110 --> 37:00.110
the solid wax drippings,

688
37:00.110 --> 37:02.110
the person in the room has long gone.

689
37:02.460 --> 37:03.960
Nine girls.

690
37:04.550 --> 37:06.350
The oldest was just 20 years old.

691
37:07.150 --> 37:08.360
Why on earth did the killer

692
37:08.360 --> 37:10.110
kill these girls?

693
37:10.960 --> 37:11.710
Do they have

694
37:11.710 --> 37:13.320
anything in common?

695
37:21.260 --> 37:22.750
On-site autopsy?

696
37:35.510 --> 37:37.070
There were no wounds on the victims' bodies

697
37:37.070 --> 37:38.480
nor any strangulation marks.

698
37:38.480 --> 37:39.280
But

699
37:39.970 --> 37:42.220
they died from being drained of all their blood.

700
37:42.220 --> 37:43.550
Drained of their blood?

701
37:43.710 --> 37:44.760
No wonder they looked

702
37:44.760 --> 37:45.920
so terrifyingly pale.

703
37:45.920 --> 37:46.800
But why did the killer

704
37:46.800 --> 37:47.920
drain their blood?

705
37:48.520 --> 37:49.960
-Once drained of blood, -Once drained of blood,

706
37:49.960 --> 37:53.690
-the bodies wouldn't rot easily. -the bodies wouldn't rot easily.

707
37:54.920 --> 37:56.150
But what did the killer

708
37:56.150 --> 37:57.150
want to do

709
37:57.150 --> 37:58.210
with their bodies?

710
37:58.960 --> 38:00.220
Lord Constable Frost!

711
38:02.360 --> 38:03.320
Lord Constable Frost,

712
38:03.320 --> 38:04.230
a silk thread was found

713
38:04.230 --> 38:05.560
on the floor of the room.

714
38:08.840 --> 38:09.630
This thread

715
38:09.630 --> 38:11.960
seems to be used for controlling puppets.

716
38:12.070 --> 38:13.320
In that case,

717
38:13.480 --> 38:15.140
the witnesses told the truth.

718
38:15.150 --> 38:16.840
It was indeed a puppeteer

719
38:16.840 --> 38:18.300
who abducted these girls.

720
38:22.280 --> 38:23.540
What's wrong, My Lord?

721
38:24.440 --> 38:25.370
This silk thread

722
38:25.710 --> 38:27.360
has a peculiar fragrance.

723
38:27.510 --> 38:28.880
A peculiar fragrance?

724
38:31.880 --> 38:32.670
Indeed.

725
38:33.360 --> 38:34.360
It's very unique.

726
38:34.500 --> 38:37.230
I have never smelled something like this before.

727
38:37.410 --> 38:38.440
The girls were

728
38:38.440 --> 38:40.240
drained of their blood to death.

729
38:40.330 --> 38:41.330
I got it.

730
39:00.480 --> 39:01.280
Stop!

731
40:08.840 --> 40:10.100
Lord Constable Frost.

732
40:10.880 --> 40:11.880
Are you

733
40:11.960 --> 40:13.680
feeling guilty toward those girls

734
40:13.680 --> 40:15.780
because you're unable to catch the real killer,

735
40:15.780 --> 40:16.610
so

736
40:16.960 --> 40:19.110
you were trapped by the illusion just now

737
40:19.110 --> 40:20.510
and willing to be bound?

738
40:21.030 --> 40:21.880
Li Qingyang.

739
40:22.480 --> 40:23.810
You escaped last night,

740
40:23.880 --> 40:25.920
but today you walked right into the trap.

741
40:25.920 --> 40:27.580
You're wrong, Your Lordship.

742
40:27.880 --> 40:28.960
I am here today

743
40:29.180 --> 40:31.050
to help you investigate the case.

744
40:31.150 --> 40:32.150
I've seen

745
40:32.150 --> 40:33.750
your skills with my own eyes.

746
40:33.960 --> 40:35.230
The illusion just now

747
40:35.440 --> 40:36.440
was your doing.

748
40:40.710 --> 40:42.070
You found out.

749
40:43.480 --> 40:44.280
That's right.

750
40:44.760 --> 40:46.320
It was indeed my doing.

751
40:46.960 --> 40:49.150
With so many Divine Constables in the manor,

752
40:49.150 --> 40:50.320
I didn't want

753
40:50.360 --> 40:51.760
them to swarm up

754
40:51.760 --> 40:53.670
and tie me up.

755
40:53.960 --> 40:54.760
So,

756
40:55.070 --> 40:56.880
I had to use an illusion

757
40:57.070 --> 40:58.550
to invite you here

758
40:58.630 --> 41:00.290
to discuss the case together.

759
41:01.360 --> 41:03.170
Not only did you appear at the murder scene

760
41:03.170 --> 41:04.550
and interfere with the investigation,

761
41:04.550 --> 41:06.760
but a puppet doll was also found in your room.

762
41:06.760 --> 41:07.670
No matter how I look at it,

763
41:07.670 --> 41:08.550
you are the prime suspect.

764
41:08.550 --> 41:09.710
Yet you say you're helping me investigate?

765
41:09.710 --> 41:11.070
Don't you think it sounds like a thief crying "catch the thief"?

766
41:11.070 --> 41:11.760
Stop.

767
41:14.480 --> 41:16.140
Whether you believe it or not,

768
41:16.630 --> 41:18.630
I share the same desire as the bureau

769
41:18.760 --> 41:20.510
to solve the case.

770
41:20.880 --> 41:21.880
Cut the crap.

771
41:21.880 --> 41:23.150
Come with me to face justice.

772
41:23.150 --> 41:24.010
Your Lordship.

773
41:24.920 --> 41:26.150
There are thousands of ways

774
41:26.150 --> 41:27.320
to kill in this world.

775
41:27.320 --> 41:28.930
Have you ever wondered

776
41:28.950 --> 41:30.910
why the killer specifically chose

777
41:30.940 --> 41:32.800
to drain their blood?

778
41:33.280 --> 41:34.110
When we get back to the bureau,

779
41:34.110 --> 41:35.510
you can talk all you want.

780
41:38.150 --> 41:40.230
"Hibiscus pales beside a beauty's blood;

781
41:40.230 --> 41:43.110
refined nine times, even dead bones turn sweet.

782
41:43.630 --> 41:45.030
I wonder if Your Lordship

783
41:45.030 --> 41:46.550
has heard of this saying.

784
41:48.320 --> 41:49.780
The Strange Medicines Chapter

785
41:49.780 --> 41:51.670
of the Tianshu Pavilion's Pharmacology Volume reads:

786
41:51.670 --> 41:53.230
"Hibiscus pales beside a beauty's blood;

787
41:53.230 --> 41:55.360
refined nine times, even dead bones turn sweet."

788
41:55.360 --> 41:56.590
Legend has it that this exotic Dead Bone Spice

789
41:56.590 --> 41:57.480
is extremely rare

790
41:57.480 --> 42:00.210
and must be refined with the blood of young girls.

791
42:14.770 --> 42:16.230
Who says the killer drains the murdered girls' blood

792
42:16.230 --> 42:17.670
to preserve the bodies?

793
42:17.670 --> 42:18.280
Their goal

794
42:18.280 --> 42:19.550
is not their bodies,

795
42:19.550 --> 42:20.670
but their blood.

796
42:21.480 --> 42:22.550
The killer drains their blood

797
42:22.550 --> 42:24.280
to refine this Dead Bone Spice.

798
42:24.320 --> 42:26.850
No wonder there's a scent on the silk threads.

799
42:30.440 --> 42:31.440
Now it seems,

800
42:31.480 --> 42:33.540
the Dead Bone Spice in Huangquan Market

801
42:33.540 --> 42:36.070
was sold out overnight.

802
42:36.520 --> 42:38.480
Now it's hard to find even a single bottle,

803
42:38.480 --> 42:39.940
making it worth a fortune.

804
42:42.320 --> 42:43.480
Lord Constable Frost,

805
42:43.480 --> 42:44.280
do you think

806
42:44.760 --> 42:46.670
the killer might be killing

807
42:46.760 --> 42:48.070
to create this spice

808
42:48.150 --> 42:50.320
for huge profits?

809
42:50.320 --> 42:51.920
If you knew how hard it is

810
42:51.920 --> 42:52.550
to create this spice,

811
42:52.550 --> 42:53.840
you wouldn't think so.

812
42:54.670 --> 42:55.630
To create this spice,

813
42:55.630 --> 42:56.760
the collected blood

814
42:56.840 --> 42:58.150
must be from a young girl

815
42:58.150 --> 42:59.480
with a pure Yin destiny.

816
43:00.150 --> 43:01.150
In the entire Tianhuang City,

817
43:01.150 --> 43:02.550
there are very few such people.

818
43:02.550 --> 43:04.150
To find 9 such girls,

819
43:04.150 --> 43:06.550
the killer must have gone to great lengths.

820
43:08.550 --> 43:11.150
Blood of a young girl with a pure Yin destiny...

821
43:14.710 --> 43:15.510
Qing Wu.

822
43:17.230 --> 43:18.030
Oh no.

823
43:35.550 --> 43:36.320
Qing Wu!

824
43:37.360 --> 43:38.150
Qing Wu!

825
43:42.550 --> 43:43.360
I'm sorry.

826
43:44.440 --> 43:45.440
I came too late.

827
43:46.840 --> 43:47.630
These

828
43:47.710 --> 43:49.440
are all the dowry gifts for you.

829
43:49.550 --> 43:50.630
I hope

830
43:50.630 --> 43:52.560
that in the future, you could find a

831
43:53.670 --> 43:55.310
better home

832
43:55.550 --> 43:57.350
than Star-Gathering Pavilion.

833
44:27.280 --> 44:29.550
She also died from having her blood drained.

834
44:29.550 --> 44:30.840
Did you see the killer?

835
44:31.760 --> 44:33.960
She was originally going to get married

836
44:34.510 --> 44:36.370
on the second day of next month...

837
44:49.150 --> 44:49.960
The killer

838
44:50.070 --> 44:51.270
should still be here.

839
44:57.440 --> 44:58.240
Take her away.

840
44:58.320 --> 44:58.960
Yes.

841
45:02.110 --> 45:03.150
Jiang Zhan, Ding Mao.

842
45:03.150 --> 45:03.590
My Lord.

843
45:03.590 --> 45:04.920
Search the Star-Gathering Pavilion thoroughly,

844
45:04.920 --> 45:06.280
and report back immediately if you find anything unusual.

845
45:06.280 --> 45:07.070
Yes. Yes.

846
45:13.320 --> 45:14.150
Li Qingyang!

847
45:17.920 --> 45:19.440
If you leave now,

848
45:19.440 --> 45:21.000
you'll be fleeing to avoid punishment.

849
45:21.000 --> 45:22.150
Although you didn't kill Qing Wu,

850
45:22.150 --> 45:23.620
you are still a suspect.

851
45:23.710 --> 45:24.550
Come back with me quickly

852
45:24.550 --> 45:25.880
and explain it clearly.

853
45:30.480 --> 45:31.480
What suspicion?

854
45:32.150 --> 45:33.230
I don't care.

855
45:34.760 --> 45:35.550
Since they laid hands on

856
45:35.550 --> 45:37.330
someone from the Star-Gathering Pavilion,

857
45:37.330 --> 45:39.240
they must pay the price.

858
45:51.390 --> 45:52.870
I will settle this score

859
45:54.230 --> 45:56.480
of what they did to Qing Wu.

860
46:01.230 --> 46:02.030
Li Si!
